---
description: Jira-to-PR conductor via shared CLI. Use when the user says dev-loop, /dev-loop, or work this Jira story.
alwaysApply: false
---

Cursor has no Claude SessionStart. Run the shared CLI (Claude constructs stay in `skills/` and `claude/`):

```bash
python3 ~/.claude/hooks/dev-loop/cli.py start KEY --repo PATH
```

Config: `~/.config/dev-conductor/dev-loop/config.yaml`. Skills: repo `skills/` (installed to `~/.cursor/skills`).

Poller: `python3 ~/.claude/hooks/dev-loop/cli.py poll` / `install-poller`. Real Jira: ATLASSIAN_* in secrets.env.
